Fonts (fonts/)
--------------
ChicagoFLF is in the public domain by statement of its author, Robin Casady
(fonts/README.ChicagoFLF). ChicagoGreek.ttf and ChicagoLight.ttf are derived
from it; the Greek letters and the thinning added here are likewise dedicated
to the public domain. Use them for anything.

The sample pictures in images/samples/ are drawn by tools/samples.html and
are covered by the MIT licence above. They do not show real people.
